flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#ffffff,stroke:#b8babe,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef friction fill:#f6f7f7,stroke:#3a3e44,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef broken fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c4362b,stroke-width:2px,color:#c4362b;
  S1["1. The plus next to Folders, or N, opens New<br/>folder; Create opens the new empty folder.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. The empty folder offers Add bookmarks, a picker<br/>of links saved elsewhere.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. Moving them shows 'Moved 2 to Media' with Undo.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. The folder three dots: Share first, then Add<br/>bookmarks, New folder inside, Rename, Move to,<br/>Hide from Recent, Lock with a password, Delete.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. Move to moves a folder under another or to the<br/>top level.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. A card shows Share, Open, Trash and More on<br/>hover; More holds Move, Copy, Share, Trash,<br/>Open, Rename, Pin.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S7["7. Move from the card's More or the selection bar<br/>says 'Moved to Work' with Undo, as a drag onto<br/>a folder does; Undo puts it back.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S8["8. Dragging a card onto a folder in the sidebar<br/>moves it with Undo.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S9["9. Rename in place: F2 or the menu, Enter saves,<br/>Escape cancels.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S10["10. Trash on a card: 'Moved to Trash' with Undo.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S11["11. Trash keeps links 30 days; a card offers<br/>Restore and Delete now, which asks first; Empty<br/>trash asks first.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S12["12. Delete folder asks first and says where its<br/>links go: 'Delete Media? 2 bookmarks go to<br/>Trash.'<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S13["13. With More open at 1280 by 800 the folder list<br/>keeps 4 of 5 folders in view and the actions<br/>scroll in their own space. The folder list's<br/>scroll bar is hidden, so the fifth folder gives<br/>no sign, and More stays open after a reload.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S14["14. Phone: Folders tab, a folder, the three dots as<br/>a sheet.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S15["15. Phone: a tap opens the link; Move, Rename and<br/>Trash come only after a long press starts<br/>selecting, and nothing on screen says so.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
